WEBVTT

00:13:28.099 --> 00:13:30.388
something that made me very happy indeed,

00:13:30.388 --> 00:13:32.919
that Kenya is in the top 30,

00:13:32.919 --> 00:13:35.804
and that demonstrates one
very, very important thing.

00:13:35.804 --> 00:13:37.667
This is not about money.

00:13:37.667 --> 00:13:39.064
This is about attitude.

00:13:39.064 --> 00:13:40.530
This is about culture.

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:43.977
This is about a government and a people that care

00:13:43.977 --> 00:13:45.171
about the rest of the world

00:13:45.171 --> 00:13:47.163
and have the imagination and the courage

00:13:47.163 --> 00:13:50.400
to think outwards instead of only thinking selfishly.

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:52.180
I'm going to whip through the other slides

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:55.128
just so you can see some
of the lower-lying countries.

00:13:55.128 --> 00:13:58.410
There's Germany at 13th, the U.S. comes 21st,

00:13:58.410 --> 00:14:00.151
Mexico comes 66th,